{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_home

    The per-site home tab shown in the app, from top to bottom: a low band of the brand with the greeting and a line that
    says the day; the children of an adult of a family; "Today", first what is about to start (with "Join"), then what
    there is to do and what is left of today; what waits for a grade; what other plugins add, two rows each with their
    own "See all"; what comes next; and the shortcuts the tab bar does not have. No JavaScript: the server decides what is
    starting, and the app asks for the home again when it opens and when it is refreshed.
    Design: the home of 13 November 2026, on the common per-client template (agents/arte/docs/aty-app-plantilla.md).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * logourl - The brand's white logo, small, in the band (may be empty).
    * greeting - "Hi, Lucía", or "Hi" when there is no first name worth saying.
    * dayline - What matters most of the day, in a line (may be empty).
    * haschildren - Whether there are children yet: then the pill to add another is a round «+» at the end of their row.
    * hasfamily, familyheading, children, familyaddname - For an adult of a family: their children as pills (id, name,
      label, initial, argsjson) and the way to add another with their code.
    * todayheading, hastoday - "Today".
    * starting, joinlabel - What is about to start: { name, timestamp, time, context, when, joinurl }.
    * todo - The rows of other plugins with something to do (mobile_home_row), with their button.
    * today - What is left of today: { name, timestamp, day, month, time, context, viewurl, kind, kindlabel }.
    * hasunread, unread, unreadlabel, messagesname, messagesurl - The unread conversations, among today's things.
    * gradingheading, grading, hasgrading - For teachers: the assignments waiting for a grade (name, context, count,
      countlabel, viewurl).
    * cards - Sections other plugins add for this user: { heading, items (mobile_home_row), seeall }. Their "See all" has
      label and where it opens (ispage, component, method, pagetitle, argsjson; or url and browser).
    * eventsheading, hasevents, events - What comes next, like today's.
    * shortcutsheading, hasshortcuts, shortcuts - The shortcuts that are not in the tab bar, and the plugins' tiles:
      { label, icon, external; and url, or ispage, component, method, pagetitle, argsjson }.
    * opensoutside - Accessible label for the "opens outside the app" marker.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "logourl": "",
        "greeting": "Hola, Lucía",
        "dayline": "Hoy tienes una clase en directo y una entrega."
    }
}}
<div class="aty-home">
    <section class="aty-franja">
        {{#logourl}}<img class="aty-franja-logo" src="{{logourl}}" alt="">{{/logourl}}
        <div class="aty-franja-texto">
            <p class="aty-franja-hola">{{greeting}}</p>
            {{#dayline}}<p class="aty-franja-dia">{{dayline}}</p>{{/dayline}}
        </div>
    </section>
    {{#hasfamily}}
    <div class="aty-hijos" role="group" aria-label="{{familyheading}}">
        {{#children}}
        <button type="button" class="aty-hijo" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_child" title="{{name}}" [args]="{{argsjson}}">
            <span class="aty-hijo-inicial" aria-hidden="true">{{initial}}</span>{{label}}
        </button>
        {{/children}}
        {{#haschildren}}
        <button type="button" class="aty-hijo aty-hijo-mas aty-hijo-solo" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_family_add" title="{{familyaddname}}" aria-label="{{familyaddname}}">
            <ion-icon name="fas-plus" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
        </button>
        {{/haschildren}}
        {{^haschildren}}
        <button type="button" class="aty-hijo aty-hijo-mas" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_family_add" title="{{familyaddname}}">
            <ion-icon name="fas-plus" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>{{familyaddname}}
        </button>
        {{/haschildren}}
    </div>
    {{/hasfamily}}
    {{#hastoday}}
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{todayheading}}</h2>
    <div class="aty-agenda">
        {{#starting}}
        <div class="aty-event aty-ahora">
            <span class="aty-event-hora">
                <b [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'strftimetime'">{{time}}</b>
                <small>{{when}}</small>
            </span>
            <span class="aty-event-body">
                <span class="aty-event-name">{{name}}</span>
                {{#context}}<span class="aty-event-context">{{context}}</span>{{/context}}
            </span>
            <a class="aty-entrar" core-link href="{{joinurl}}" capture="false">{{joinlabel}}</a>
        </div>
        {{/starting}}
        {{#todo}}
        {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_home_row }}
        {{/todo}}
        {{#today}}
        <a class="aty-event" core-link href="{{viewurl}}" capture="true">
            {{#time}}
            <span class="aty-event-hora{{#kind}} aty-hora-plazo{{/kind}}">
                <b [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'strftimetime'">{{time}}</b>
                {{#kindlabel}}<small>{{kindlabel}}</small>{{/kindlabel}}
            </span>
            {{/time}}
            {{^time}}
            <span class="aty-event-date">
                <span class="aty-event-day" [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'%e'">{{day}}</span>
                <span class="aty-event-month" [textContent]="({{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'%b').replace('.', '')">{{month}}</span>
            </span>
            {{/time}}
            <span class="aty-event-body">
                <span class="aty-event-name">{{name}}</span>
                {{#context}}<span class="aty-event-context">{{context}}</span>{{/context}}
            </span>
        </a>
        {{/today}}
        {{#hasunread}}
        <a class="aty-event aty-grading" core-link href="{{messagesurl}}" capture="true">
            <span class="aty-event-date">
                <span class="aty-event-day">{{unread}}</span>
                <span class="aty-event-month">{{unreadlabel}}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="aty-event-body">
                <span class="aty-event-name">{{messagesname}}</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        {{/hasunread}}
    </div>
    {{/hastoday}}
    {{#hasgrading}}
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{gradingheading}}</h2>
    <div class="aty-agenda">
        {{#grading}}
        <a class="aty-event aty-grading" core-link href="{{viewurl}}" capture="true">
            <span class="aty-event-date">
                <span class="aty-event-day">{{count}}</span>
                <span class="aty-event-month">{{countlabel}}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="aty-event-body">
                <span class="aty-event-name">{{name}}</span>
                <span class="aty-event-context">{{context}}</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        {{/grading}}
    </div>
    {{/hasgrading}}
    {{#cards}}
    <div class="aty-seccion-cab">
        <h2 class="aty-section">{{heading}}</h2>
        {{#seeall}}
        {{#ispage}}<button type="button" class="aty-ver" core-site-plugins-new-content component="{{component}}" method="{{method}}" title="{{pagetitle}}" [args]="{{argsjson}}">{{label}}</button>{{/ispage}}
        {{^ispage}}<a class="aty-ver" core-link href="{{url}}" capture="{{^browser}}true{{/browser}}{{#browser}}false{{/browser}}"{{^browser}} inApp="true"{{/browser}}>{{label}}</a>{{/ispage}}
        {{/seeall}}
    </div>
    <div class="aty-agenda">
        {{#items}}
        {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_home_row }}
        {{/items}}
    </div>
    {{/cards}}
    {{#hasevents}}
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{eventsheading}}</h2>
    <div class="aty-agenda">
        {{#events}}
        <a class="aty-event" core-link href="{{viewurl}}" capture="true">
            <span class="aty-event-date">
                <span class="aty-event-day" [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'%e'">{{day}}</span>
                <span class="aty-event-month" [textContent]="({{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'%b').replace('.', '')">{{month}}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="aty-event-body">
                <span class="aty-event-name">{{name}}</span>
                {{#context}}<span class="aty-event-context">{{context}}</span>{{/context}}
            </span>
            {{#kindlabel}}<span class="aty-plazo"><small>{{kindlabel}}</small><b [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'strftimetime'">{{time}}</b></span>{{/kindlabel}}
            {{^kindlabel}}{{#time}}<span class="aty-event-time" [textContent]="{{timestamp}} | coreFormatDate:'strftimetime'">{{time}}</span>{{/time}}{{/kindlabel}}
        </a>
        {{/events}}
    </div>
    {{/hasevents}}
    {{#hasshortcuts}}
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{shortcutsheading}}</h2>
    <div class="aty-atajos">
        {{#shortcuts}}
        {{#ispage}}<button type="button" class="aty-atajo" core-site-plugins-new-content component="{{component}}" method="{{method}}" title="{{pagetitle}}" [args]="{{argsjson}}">{{/ispage}}
        {{^ispage}}<a class="aty-atajo" core-link href="{{url}}" capture="{{^external}}true{{/external}}{{#external}}false{{/external}}"{{^external}} inApp="true"{{/external}}>{{/ispage}}
            <ion-icon class="aty-atajo-icono" name="{{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>{{label}}
            {{#external}}<ion-icon class="aty-atajo-fuera" name="fas-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-label="{{opensoutside}}"></ion-icon>{{/external}}
        {{#ispage}}</button>{{/ispage}}
        {{^ispage}}</a>{{/ispage}}
        {{/shortcuts}}
    </div>
    {{/hasshortcuts}}
</div>
